    "text": "By Eric Miller ,\n6 hours ago Man recalls swimming through floodwaters to safety in middle of Helene. Note: These stories are a series of profiles accompanying the WRAL documentary leading up to the premiere of “Helene: What We Lost, What We Found,” a powerful new investigative documentary examining the devastation and resilience that followed Hurricane Helene in Western North Carolina. Watch the documentary beginning Thursday, Sept. 25, on WRAL-TV and everywhere you stream on WRAL. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 9",
